      "completion": "not_triggered",
      "explanation": "No bounded closure was achieved. The doctor did not specify that this episode does not resolve the short stature issue, nor mention the need for continued pediatric/endocrine follow‑up for GH, IGF‑1, etc.",
      "ho_id": "HO4",
